  m_text: '<b>MOVE</b>    WASD or Arrow Keys


    <b>BITE</b>    E, next to a civilian


    <b>PAUSE</b>  
    Escape or P


    <b>SHIELD</b>    1    (4 Cost)

    <b>SACRIFICE</b>    2   
    (3 Cost)

    <b>ATTACK</b>    3    (2 Cost)


    Abilities spend followers.
    You cannot spend yourself.

    Hunger falls on its own. Bite civilians before
    it runs out.'
